          <div class="space-y-6">
            
            <!-- Item 1 -->
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm card-tactile">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gold-400/20 text-gold-700 font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-serif shrink-0">01</span>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">
                  Sorria sem esconder a boca.
                </h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pl-11">
                Pr├│teses que n├úo mancham com caf├® ou vinho, com brilho id├¬ntico ao natural para voc├¬ voltar a sorrir em p├║blico.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 2 -->
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm card-tactile">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
                <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-gold-400/20 text-gold-700 font-bold text-sm flex items-center justify-center font-serif shrink-0">02</span>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">
                  Mastigue carnes e alimentos duros.
                </h3>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed pl-11">
                A raiz de tit├ónio devolve a for├ºa mastigat├│ria. Esque├ºa dores repentinas ou o medo de quebrar a pr├│tese.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 3 -->
            <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-sm card-tactile">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
